# Mipove — Cursor guidance

Authoritative rules live in **`.cursor/rules/*.mdc`** (YAML frontmatter + markdown). Cursor loads those automatically.

- **`mipove-core.mdc`** — always on: role, stack, quality, Git, DRY, performance hints, token-efficient agent behavior.
- **`mipove-components.mdc`** — when editing files under `components/**/*.tsx`.

Extend with more `.mdc` files in `.cursor/rules/` for areas like `app/**` or `lib/**` if you want file-scoped rules later.
